<title>BELGIUM: EU beef labelling due to be voted by ministers.</title>
<headline>EU beef labelling due to be voted by ministers.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Agriculture Council is expected on Monday to accept the European Commission's cattle identification and beef labelling proposal.</p>
<p>&quot;Portugal has tabled a technical question but ministers are expected to vote the proposal through on the nod,&quot; Commission spokesman Gerrard Kiely said on Friday.</p>
</text>
